{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL"]]},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLBeam"}],"symbolKind":"struct","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL7MXLBeamV","title":"MXLBeam","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLBeam","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Beam values include begin, continue, end, forward hook, and backward hook. Up to eight concurrent beams are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"available to cover up to 1024th notes. Each beam in a note is represented with a separate beam element,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"starting with the eighth note beam using a number attribute of 1."}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLBeam"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note that the beam number does not distinguish sets of beams that overlap, as it does for slur and other"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"elements. Beaming groups are distinguished by being in different voices and\/or the presence or absence of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"grace and cue elements."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Beams that have a begin value can also have a fan attribute to indicate accelerandos and ritardandos using"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fanned beams. The fan attribute may also be used with a continue value if the fanning direction changes on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that note. The value is “none” if not specified."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The repeater attribute has been deprecated in MusicXML 3.0. Formerly used for tremolos, it needs to be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specified with a “yes” value for each beam using it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Maps the MusicXML "},{"code":"<beam>","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" element."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLBeam\/init(id:value:number:repeater:fan:color:)"]},{"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLBeam\/color","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLBeam\/fan","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLBeam\/id","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLBeam\/number","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLBeam\/repeater","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLBeam\/value"]},{"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLBeam\/Equatable-Implementations"]}],"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/SQ","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/SH","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlbeam"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLBeam"},"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/s9EscapableP":{"title":"Swift.Escapable","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s9EscapableP","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLBeam/fan":{"type":"topic","